# final-adaptive: the headline configuration with the vote fix in its ADAPTIVE form, for the comparison
# the user asked for on 2026-11-13 (runs 2 and 2b ran benchmark/arms/final.arm, the always-on form).
# Identical to final.arm except quorum_exec_block_starved_rounds 4: a header names its proposer's own tip
# until an own header is cancelled, then the quorum rule for a window of rounds.
# Kept outside benchmark/arms/ so that the harness tree and its tests stay as they were for runs 2 and 2b.
# No host step, as final.arm: a node that never started has nothing to evict.
name final-adaptive
param mdbx_random_advice true
param quorum_exec_block true
param quorum_exec_block_starved_rounds 4
param vote_queue_fix true
param epoch_record_state_check true
